<!--
  sitemap.xml · האופה - בוטיק לחם · draft 2026-10-24
  - Replace https://haofe.example with the real canonical origin (https, one host, no trailing slash on paths).
  - List only canonical, indexable URLs that return 200. Generate it at build time from the same page list the site uses.
  - lastmod = the date that page's content last changed (from the build), not the deploy date of every page.
  - Never listed: the 404 page, UTM-tagged URLs, staging hosts, /assets/ai/ images, external URLs.
    The site has no /order page: ordering is by phone only (owner decision 24.10.2026).
  - changefreq and priority are left out on purpose: Google ignores them.
-->
